setMaxUtilization.t.sol
├── when caller does not have the {ADMIN_ROLE}
│   └── it should revert with {AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount} error
└── when caller has {ADMIN_ROLE}
    ├── when the new max utilization exceeds {MAX_UTILIZATION}
    │   └── it should revert with {POOL__INVALID_MAX_UTILIZATION} error
    └── when the new max utilization does not exceed {MAX_UTILIZATION}
        ├── it should update the max utilization
        └── it should emit the {MaxUtilizationUpdated} event
